What?!

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.640
Th-This power is...

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:55.990
<i>Object crash. State change.</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:18.050
<i>Over the time limit.</i>

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:19.800
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:23.050
Kamiki...

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:25.350
Sekai Kamiki!

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:30.600
I got it.

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:34.190
<i>What a guy.<i></i></i>

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:39.700
<i>Unifying his own feelings...
No, even his own body with the Gunpla,</i>

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:42.160
<i>to bring out its full performance.</i>

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:49.790
<i>The machine that Sei lori used in the World
Championship, the Star Build Strike Gundam,</i>

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:54.710
<i>had a system which permeated its frame
with particles and accelerated its output.</i>

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:58.050
<i>This is as good as that
RG system, or even better.</i>

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:07.640
<i>I can't believe a fighter could do that
with mental strength alone.</i>

00:02:11.350 --> 00:02:12.940
<i>I found the one.</i>

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:14.150
<i>I accept you.</i>

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.610
<i>Wilfrid Kijima.</i>

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:18.230
<i>Sekai Kamiki.</i>

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:19.320
<i>You...</i>

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:20.570
<i>You are...</i>

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:24.070
<i>You're my rival!
You're my rival!</i>

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:48.140
<i>Our wings couldn't wait for the wind, so we set out</i>

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:53.600
<i>We were bathed in the light of the frozen sun</i>

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:56.400
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh there are no limits</i>

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:59.110
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh just let it go</i>

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:04.700
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh loneliness won't break us</i>

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:09.240
<i>At the end of the dream we'll never give up,</i>

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:11.870
<i>Will there be a future that can never end?</i>

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:17.460
<i>Believe in what only you can do</i>

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:20.170
<i>If I could seize one thing,</i>

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:22.880
<i>I'd choose it without hesitation</i>

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:28.140
<i>Follow your instincts, just hold on to our bond</i>

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:34.730
<i>Up to the endless sky, now! Fly away</i>

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:56.080
<i>GUNDAM BUILD FIGHTERS TRY</i>

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.890
You seem to be having fun, Brother.

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:11.640
It's you who made me
feel like this, Shia.

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.060
Pardon me?

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:14.730
You can't fool me.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:18.690
I can see it by the moves of
Kamiki's Build Burning.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:20.570
You did something
to that machine, right?

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:22.440
Are you angry?

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:23.780
No way.

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:25.400
I actually appreciate it.

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.860
Because I've met a worthy rival.

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:32.160
I thought you'd say that.

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:36.210
Episode 14
Worthy Rivals

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:41.960
Sekai, put the luggage in the trunk.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:42.840
Okay.

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:46.090
I'm glad we came.

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:49.470
It helped me remember
something important.

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:50.890
Me too.

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:53.680
When we get back home,
I have to build a new Gunpla.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:56.310
It's ten days until the tournament.

00:04:56.390 --> 00:04:58.400
If we work together, we can do it.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:04:59.440
That's right.

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:02.570
Yuuma, what are you doing?
We'll leave you behind!

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:03.730
I know.

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:07.570
Honestly. Being ordered around by
the guy who faints every time he battles.

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:12.240
But that means he's so in synch with his Gunpla
that he fights until he passes out. That's incredible.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:15.250
I can respect that, too.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.580
That guy"-

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:23.880
He's from the Gunpla Academy.

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:26.590
Wilfrid Kijima.

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:28.630
Sekai Kamiki.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:31.140
Please tell me one thing.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:34.510
In the battle yesterday,

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:37.270
the technique that you and
the Build Burning used...

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:41.980
What was that?

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:44.650
I don't know either.

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:48.280
But it wasn't one of the
Jigen Haoh techniques I learned.

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:53.030
It's a new technique which
the Build Burning and I found.

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:56.080
So it's your own original, huh?

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:58.080
That's even more exciting.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:05:59.210
Kamiki,

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:02.540
I look forward to facing you
in the National Tournament.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:04.210
Yeah, same here!

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:11.550
What are you doing, Kijima?
It's time to go!

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:13.180
I'm coming.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:14.300
Hurry UP-

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:16.930
It's Yuuma Kousaka!

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:17.640
What?

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:19.930
Remember that name.

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:23.150
It's the name of the man who'll
defeat you in the nationals!

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:30.950
Yuuma Kousaka.

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:32.700
Right.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.040
Alright, I'll remember it.

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.790
Don't disappoint me.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:42.290
I promise.

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.640
She was from the Gunpla Academy?

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:57.970
But...

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:04.310
Why did she teach me
how to fix plastic models?

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:12.150
The Gunpla Academy is running
away with its winnings?

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:15.820
I wish we could've
gathered a little more data.

00:07:15.820 --> 00:07:18.080
But we can collect more
at the National Tournament.

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:21.200
This year, we'll win.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:24.960
Yes, we three brothers.

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:29.880
We'll dominate the nationals.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:33.220
Don't forget about me!

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:41.520
Who is he?

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:42.020
<i>No idea.</i>

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.060
Don't know him.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:48.060
Karima! I'm Kei Karima from Honmoku
Academy, representing Kanagawa!

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:50.020
We fought at last year's
National Tournament.

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:52.820
Did we?

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:53.950
I don't know.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:54.950
I forgot.

00:07:55.150 --> 00:07:57.870
Wh-What?!

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:04.330
Darn you! Don't you forget me!

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:08.790
Like we said, we forgot you.
Like we said, we forgot you.

00:08:12.710 --> 00:08:16.720
Sekai, did you know that girl
was from the Gunpla Academy?

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:18.260
Not at all.

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:22.810
So you let a rival tinker
with the Build Burning.

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:25.560
She just showed me how to fix it.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:28.520
And you even let her
improve its performance.

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:33.820
<i>But before saying that,
go and defeat that girl first.</i>

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:39.240
<i>Maybe the girl that
Ms. Lady was talking about...</i>

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:40.490
Hoshino?

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:42.870
<i>No, there's no doubt about it.</i>

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:45.200
<i>Surely...</i>

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:47.420
<i>It has to be that girl.</i>

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:50.750
Osaka Qualifiers Venue

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:53.130
Osaka Qualifiers Venue
There are only ten days
until the National Tournament.

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:56.050
The representative
hasn't been decided yet?

00:08:56.470 --> 00:09:00.260
There was a problem with the venue,
and the battle was postponed.

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:03.770
Well, we'll see if they
saved the best for last.

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:08.140
The final match has already started.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:16.900
We'll win quickly in close combat.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:17.780
Yeah!
Yeah!

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:21.620
Wh-What?!

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:25.700
This beam?!

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:28.370
It's not a Mega Launcher or Burst Mode!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:29.540
Run!

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:41.720
