<i>In the Osaka qualifiers of the Gunpla Battle
Japanese Under-19 Championship,</i>

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:51.600
<i>Tendaiji Academy Taibokujin High</i>
<i>the champion is team Build Busters</i>
