00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:54.980
<i>Tendaiii Academy
the champion is team Build Busters
from Tendaiji Academy.</i>

00:09:55.230 --> 00:09:56.650
Build Busters?

00:09:56.980 --> 00:09:58.990
A team name with a double-meaning.

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:00.820
Where did they...?

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.120
H-He's from the Shingyo School.

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:10.250
Meijin.

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:11.330
No way...

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.040
Not only the Eastern,

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:16.670
but also the Western master will
enter the National Tournament.

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:24.390
I'm home!

00:10:25.510 --> 00:10:27.140
Welcome back, Sekai.

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:31.600
Sis, from today until the tournament,
we're going to hold a training camp here.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:33.520
Huh? Training camp?

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:37.190
Thank you for having us!
Thank you for having us!

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:38.650
What?

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:41.150
Um...

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:45.030
Well, today we're having curry...

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:46.660
ls that okay?

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:56.250
I've decided on an
upgrade plan for my Lightning.

00:10:57.040 --> 00:10:59.210
Enhanced firepower and mobility...

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:01.050
That time,

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:05.220
when I borrowed Meijin Kawaguchi's
Amazing Red Warrior,

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.470
I realized what
my Gunpla was lacking.

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:11.810
And you, Hoshino?

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:13.440
I'll build it based on the Winning.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:17.480
Without changing its basic role
of supporting you two,

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:19.780
I'll aim to give it more
individual power.

00:11:20.230 --> 00:11:22.360
The keywords are SD and real.

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:27.330
And what about my Build Burning?

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:31.290
You should've realized it from
your battle with the Gunpla Academy.

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:33.210
The technique you used at the end...

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:38.750
Your Gunpla was screaming from
the massive particle emission.

00:11:42.170 --> 00:11:46.390
The upgrade plan for Build Burning
is to reinforce each joint's armor.

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:48.430
And...

00:11:48.510 --> 00:11:49.010
And?

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:52.730
Install a system I came up with,

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:55.770
which can maximize its particle emission.

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:59.110
I call it the Burning Burst system.

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:02.070
Burning Burst system...

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:03.570
Yes.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:06.990
It'll be our team Try Fighter's
ace in the hole.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:08.620
Let's build it!

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:10.950
Our goal is to dominate
the National Tournament,

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:12.540
and defeat the Gunpla Academy!

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:13.870
Yeah!
Yeah!

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:46.780
<i>Our wings couldn't wait for the wind, so we set out</i>

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:52.240
<i>We were bathed in the light of the frozen sun</i>

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:55.000
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh there are no limits</i>

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.750
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh just let it go</i>

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:03.340
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh loneliness won't break us</i>

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:07.840
<i>At the end of the dream we'll never give up,</i>

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:10.510
<i>Will there be a future that can never end?</i>

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:16.060
<i>Believe in what only you can do</i>

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:18.810
<i>If I could seize one thing,</i>

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:21.520
<i>I'd choose it without hesitation</i>

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:26.780
<i>Follow your instincts, just hold on to our bond</i>

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:33.370
<i>Up to the endless sky, now! Fly away</i>

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:04.520
Good work.

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:05.900
Thank you.

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:07.570
Oh, Miss Mirai.

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:10.070
Ms. Karin!

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:11.860
Good work today.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:13.910
By the way, Ms. Karin,

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:17.580
you were chosen as the Gunpla Battle
Championship image character, right?

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:19.160
Yeah.

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:21.870
My son loves Gunpla,

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.750
so I tried pretty hard.

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:27.880
My little brother's also entering
the National Tournament.

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:29.720
Oh, really?

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.680
Then, at the venue...

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:35.220
Ms. Karin?

00:14:38.220 --> 00:14:40.390
Are you alright?

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.600
I'm fine.

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.770
This may be...

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:51.740
Oh! Congratulations!

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:53.110
Thank you.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:56.990
Are you alright?

00:14:58.950 --> 00:15:00.410
Ms. Karin?!

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:07.420
Where's Hoshino?

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:09.840
She went home for
a change of clothes.

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:16.720
<i>This is the first time I've
taken the Build Burning apart.</i>

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:20.980
<i>The transparent parts
for particle emission...</i>

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:23.310
<i>...are buried in hidden areas.</i>

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:26.810
<i>An application of the RG system...</i>

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:28.400
<i>There's no doubt.</i>

00:15:28.480 --> 00:15:29.650
<i>This Gunpla...</i>

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:32.240
<i>...was built by Mr. Sei lori.</i>

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:34.660
<i>On top of that,</i>

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:36.530
<i>the repair level of these parts...</i>

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:42.080
<i>Sekai is an amateur
at Gunpla building.</i>

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:46.330
<i>Merely by teaching him how,
she had him revamp it so perfectly.</i>

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:51.340
<i>It means the Gunpla Academy
is top-notch at building, too.</i>

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:53.470
<i>But I'll give it a try.</i>

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:57.550
<i>Using every technique
that I have as a builder,</i>

00:15:57.550 --> 00:16:01.270
<i>I'll make this Build Burning
the strongest Gunpla.</i>

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:02.560
But before that...

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:04.560
Get over here and help me!

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:06.150
Just a little bit more.

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:07.810
Sekai.

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:09.360
Gyanko.

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:12.320
You're building Gunpla
for the nationals, right?

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:13.990
Let me help you guys!

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:15.610
Oh, thanks!

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:16.780
Right!

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:20.080
What?

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:21.540
You need to help, too!

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:33.920
Thank you, Shia,

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:36.970
for tuning both Adou's and my Gunpla.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:38.590
It's no big deal.

00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:40.970
Big Brother's is fine,

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:42.890
but Mr. Adou's is terrible.

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:45.730
I pity his Gunpla, being handled like this.

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:50.440
I can use it recklessly because
I know you'll fix it nicely.

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:52.440
Flattery won't work.

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:53.900
Okay, I'm sorry.

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:57.610
Shia, which Gunpla will you
use in the tournament?

00:16:57.610 --> 00:16:59.450
I'm building a new one.

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:02.580
Building? So it's not finished?

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:05.330
Don't worry. I'll complete it in time.

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:06.790
Anyway!

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:09.670
I heard some interesting news
while I was studying abroad.

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:10.250
What is it?

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:15.260
The European junior champ will
briefly attend school in Japan.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.680
The European junior champ?

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:19.090
That guy"-

00:17:19.090 --> 00:17:20.760
Do you know him, Kijima?

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:23.600
Only from rumors.

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:26.640
Apparently there's a boy
who's been undefeated in Europe.

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:28.770
His name is Lucas...

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:33.020
Lucas Nemesis.

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:35.440
Lucas.

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:38.070
Would you show me your ability?

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:41.490
You may choose any Gunpla
you like in this room.

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:44.950
Then let me use that Jegan.

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:47.870
Why a Jegan?

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:51.710
Let's say it's just
a childish sentiment.

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.750
If what Shia heard is true...

00:17:56.010 --> 00:18:00.050
This Lucas will be at
the nationals, won't he?

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:01.680
It's very possible.

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:03.800
Isn't that good news?

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:04.930
Yeah.

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:08.980
The National Tournament
is gonna be fun!

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:35.040
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:40.130
You're the European
junior champ, all right.

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:44.680
I can't believe you defeated
our regular fighters so easily.

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:49.270
I'm so glad I invited you
to attend our school.

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:52.310
This will put an end to
the Gunpla Academy's reign.

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:56.360
I'll do my very best
to meet your expectations.

00:18:57.730 --> 00:18:59.240
I'm back!

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:02.700
Sorry for being late.

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:06.740
Sekai, you're good!

00:19:06.990 --> 00:19:10.500
With this, Build Burning can
fight for another ten years.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:12.040
Really?

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:17.500
Now, if you just add this shield...

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:18.670
Wh-What...

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:20.510
What are you doing, Gyanko?!

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:21.840
Isn't it obvious?

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:25.090
I'm helping Sekai build his Gunpla.

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:26.760
You're distracting him!

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:34.850
Three days until the National Tournament.

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:38.150
Akira Suga.

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:45.990
Junya Inose!

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:47.990
It's been two years, huh?

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:50.120
Oh, is that so?

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:52.620
Why'd you leave the Gunpla Academy?

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.540
Due to family matters.

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:56.040
What a stupid reason.

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:59.420
And you lost the regional qualifiers?

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:04.170
The guy they called "Speedy Sleggar"
has fallen pretty low, hasn't he?

00:20:04.170 --> 00:20:07.850
I want to enjoy playing Gunpla Battle.

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:09.140
What?

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:11.810
If you don't get it, I'll tell you.

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:14.730
I'll never again play Gunpla Battle...

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:16.900
...with a despicable man like you.

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:18.980
Oh, really?

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:21.440
So you're running from me as well.

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.070
Don't worry.

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:25.150
The guy who beat me won't run away.

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:28.820
I'll tell you something.

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:30.490
The guy who defeated me...

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:33.620
...uses the Jigen Haoh School of Kenpo.

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:34.750
What?

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:37.000
He's from the same school as you.

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:43.760
It seems the nationals will be
full of surprises this year.

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:00.270
Gabai Institute

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:06.990
Tendaiji Academy

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:24.920
Hey, Kamiki.

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:26.630
I heard.

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:27.840
You're building your new-

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:29.220
Wait, Gyanko!

00:21:29.590 --> 00:21:32.050
Don't put any weapons on
my Winning without asking.

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:34.810
Are you saying
you don't like my shield?

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:36.430
Of course I am!

00:21:36.430 --> 00:21:38.850
Don't reject people's kindness!

00:21:38.850 --> 00:21:40.440
You're such a pain!

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:42.980
You just did it to show off in front of Sekai!

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:43.820
Do you guys really plan to win?
You just did it to show off in front of Sekai!

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:44.690
Do you guys really plan to win?
What?!

00:21:44.690 --> 00:21:46.110
Do you guys really plan to win?

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:47.950
Just mind your own business!

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:50.570
I made this for you!

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:59.500
<i>There's a tomorrow I want to touch</i>

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:02.840
<i>I want to prove it for myself</i>

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:07.670
<i>Love, hate, which is it?</i>

00:22:08.420 --> 00:22:11.510
<i>Perhaps the challenge is in the journey</i>

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:14.600
<i>Wandering the unknown path...</i>

00:22:14.600 --> 00:22:21.350
<i>...toward abundant happiness</i>

00:22:23.110 --> 00:22:26.070
<i>I was afraid to run</i>

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:29.490
<i>But now that I've started, I can't stop</i>

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:32.280
<i>I must've been waiting for the go sign</i>

00:22:32.280 --> 00:22:36.120
<i>With this passion in my impatient heart,</i>

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:40.790
<i>I want to search for something</i>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:45.540
<i>Let's meet over and over again (with you)</i>

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:47.840
<i>On this journey, can you show me...</i>

00:22:47.840 --> 00:22:52.890
<i>...a different truth? (let me see)</i>

00:22:52.890 --> 00:22:59.810
<i>The power to find new things (with me)</i>

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:03.400
<i>Never forget it</i>

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:05.690
<i>Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:06.230
<i>(Today)
Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:07.860
<i>(Today)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:23:07.860 --> 00:23:08.730
<i>(I'll be there...)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:23:08.730 --> 00:23:11.740
<i>(I'll be there...)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:23:11.740 --> 00:23:14.070
<i>(Alive!)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:23:14.070 --> 00:23:15.070
<i>(Alive!)</i>

00:23:15.070 --> 00:23:20.950
Team Try Fighters!

00:23:22.460 --> 00:23:23.620
I'm home!

00:23:24.120 --> 00:23:25.540
Listen, Sekai.

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:28.750
This is sudden, but I'll be
at the Gunpla Battle-

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:39.770
There are... more people.

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:49.020
You finished them all together.

00:23:51.190 --> 00:23:53.110
So these are...

00:23:54.660 --> 00:23:56.450
...their new Gunpla.

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:02.000
Finally, the opening of
the National Tournament.

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:03.540
We are reborn.

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:05.460
We'll show it to our rivals!

00:24:05.460 --> 00:24:06.210
Next episode, "Reborn Try Fighters".

00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:07.540
Reborn Try Fighters!
Next episode, "Reborn Try Fighters".

00:24:07.540 --> 00:24:09.960
Reborn Try Fighters!
We'll show you our power!
